# Build outputs (same discipline as the repo-root build/: state dirs stay out of version control)
#
# Host tools build **out of tree**: the canonical location is <repo>/build/host/<host-arch>/<host-os>/{bin,lib,obj}
# (see ../../mk/host.mk), covered by the repo root .gitignore's `build/`.
#
# The three lines below are **source-tree artifacts left by the first cut** (migration fallback):
# today's rules no longer produce them; kept in case an old tree checkout drags them in.
cxx/*.o
cxx/*.a
cxx/brickie-gen
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
